 [ref=e1116]\n                - generic [ref=e1118]: Each Crude Oil WTI futures contract represents 1,000 Barrels.\n              - generic [ref=e1119]:\n                - heading \"When Is the Next Settlement Date for Crude Oil WTI Futures?\" [level=3] [ref=e1122]\n                - generic [ref=e1124]: The next settlement date for Crude Oil WTI futures is 03/20/2026.\n              - generic [ref=e1125]:\n                - heading \"What Is the Tick Size and Value of Crude Oil WTI Futures?\" [level=3] [ref=e1128]\n                - generic [ref=e1130]: The tick size for Crude Oil WTI futures is 0.01, with a tick value of 10.\n              - generic [ref=e1131]:\n                - heading \"Is Crude Oil WTI a Buy or Sell Based on Technical Indicators?\" [level=3] [ref=e1134]\n                - generic [ref=e1136]: Based on technical indicators and moving averages, the daily buy/sell signal is Strong Buy.\n              - generic [ref=e1137]:\n                - heading \"What Is the Base Symbol for Crude Oil WTI Futures?\" [level=3] [ref=e1140]\n                - generic [ref=e1142]: The base symbol for Crude Oil WTI futures is T.\n              - generic [ref=e1143]:\n                - heading \"What Is the Point Value of Crude Oil WTI Futures?\" [level=3] [ref=e1146]\n                - generic [ref=e1148]: For Crude Oil WTI futures, each point is worth 1,000 USD.\n              - generic [ref=e1149]:\n                - heading \"What Is the Crude Oil WTI Futures Open Price Today?\" [level=3] [ref=e1152]\n                - generic [ref=e1154]: The open price for Crude Oil WTI futures today is 87.29.\n            - generic [ref=e1156]:\n              - generic [ref=e1157]:\n                - heading \"Industry Spotlight\" [level=2] [ref=e1158]\n                - generic [ref=e1159]:\n                  - button [disabled] [ref=e1160]:\n                    - img [ref=e1161]\n                  - button [ref=e1164] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - img [ref=e116